{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/22948","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:05.821643+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"This is still a bug in TileAndFuse where we have a memref.copy generated after scf.forall bufferization.","created_at":"2026-04-08T17:10:00Z","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/22948#issuecomment-4208050649","id":4208050649,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/22948","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M760cHZ","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":1,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":1,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/4208050649/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-04-08T17:10:00Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/4208050649","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51270680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groverkss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groverkss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groverkss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groverkss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Groverkss","id":51270680,"login":"Groverkss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjcwNjgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groverkss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groverkss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groverkss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groverkss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groverkss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groverkss","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5477224?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bangtianliu","id":5477224,"login":"bangtianliu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NzcyMjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5477224?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bangtianliu","id":5477224,"login":"bangtianliu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NzcyMjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bangtianliu","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"## Description\n\nWhen compiling a nhwc_fhc convolution (convolving only over the height dimension) with unaligned spatial dimensions, the IREE compiler fails with a workgroup distribution verification error.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce your issue\n\n## Reproducer\n\n**MLIR input (`nhwc_fhc.mlir`):**\n\n#map = affine_map<(d0, d1, d2, d3, d4, d5) -> (d0, d1 + d4, d2, d5)>\n#map1 = affine_map<(d0, d1, d2, d3, d4, d5) -> (d3, d4, d5)>\n#map2 = affine_map<(d0, d1, d2, d3, d4, d5) -> (d0, d1, d2, d3)>\nmodule {\n  func.func @conv_nhwc_filter_5x1_unaligned(%arg0: tensor<16x42x19x64xbf16>, %arg1: tensor<64x5x64xbf16>, %arg2: tensor<16x38x19x64xf32>) -> tensor<16x38x19x64xf32> {\n    %0 = linalg.generic {indexing_maps = [#map, #map1, #map2], iterator_types = [\"parallel\", \"parallel\", \"parallel\", \"parallel\", \"reduction\", \"reduction\"]} ins(%arg0, %arg1 : tensor<16x42x19x64xbf16>, tensor<64x5x64xbf16>) outs(%arg2 : tensor<16x38x19x64xf32>) {\n    ^bb0(%in: bf16, %in_0: bf16, %out: f32):\n      %1 = arith.extf %in : bf16 to f32\n      %2 = arith.extf %in_0 : bf16 to f32\n      %3 = arith.mulf %1, %2 : f32\n      %4 = arith.addf %out, %3 : f32\n      linalg.yield %4 : f32\n    } -> tensor<16x38x19x64xf32>\n    return %0 : tensor<16x38x19x64xf32>\n  }\n}\n\n**Command:**\n\n`iree-compile --iree-hal-target-device=hip --iree-hip-target=gfx942 nhwc_fhc.mlir -o tmp.vmfb`\n\n## Error Message\n\n```\nnhwc_fhc.mlir:6:10: error: 'vector.transfer_write' op write affecting operations on global resources are restricted to workgroup distributed contexts.\n    %0 = linalg.generic {indexing_maps = [#map, #map1, #map2], ...\n         ^\nnhwc_fhc.mlir:6:10: error: 'func.func' op failed on workgroup distribution verification\n```\n\n### Version information\n\nIREE Version 8062674\n\n### Additional context\n\nWorks for aligned case\n``` mlir\n#map = affine_map<(d0, d1, d2, d3, d4, d5) -> (d0, d1 + d4, d2, d5)>\n#map1 = affine_map<(d0, d1, d2, d3, d4, d5) -> (d3, d4, d5)>\n#map2 = affine_map<(d0, d1, d2, d3, d4, d5) -> (d0, d1, d2, d3)>\nmodule {\n  func.func @conv_nhwc_filter_5x1_aligned(%arg0: tensor<16x36x32x64xbf16>, %arg1: tensor<64x5x64xbf16>, %arg2: tensor<16x32x32x64xf32>) -> tensor<16x32x32x64xf32> {\n    %0 = linalg.generic {indexing_maps = [#map, #map1, #map2], iterator_types = [\"parallel\", \"parallel\", \"parallel\", \"parallel\", \"reduction\", \"reduction\"]} ins(%arg0, %arg1 : tensor<16x36x32x64xbf16>, tensor<64x5x64xbf16>) outs(%arg2 : tensor<16x32x32x64xf32>) {\n    ^bb0(%in: bf16, %in_0: bf16, %out: f32):\n      %1 = arith.extf %in : bf16 to f32\n      %2 = arith.extf %in_0 : bf16 to f32\n      %3 = arith.mulf %1, %2 : f32\n      %4 = arith.addf %out, %3 : f32\n      linalg.yield %4 : f32\n    } -> tensor<16x32x32x64xf32>\n    return %0 : tensor<16x32x32x64xf32>\n  }\n}\n```","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/22948/comments","created_at":"2025-12-19T00:35:08Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/22948/events","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/22948","id":3745440833,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":false,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1553038945,"name":"bug 🐞","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTUzMDM4OTQ1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/labels/bug%20%F0%9F%90%9E"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/22948/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDODGgK6M7fPuRB","number":22948,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/22948/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree","state":"open","state_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"completed":0,"percent_completed":0,"total":0},"timeline_url":"h